From 5fb12ab4a56efd365d7d451d181f6e2a41c9d31d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: vince <vincepaul.liem@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 22:28:25 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] feat(vfs): add bounded writable metadata and file positioning

Add virtual inode metadata, owned directories, mode changes, seek,
append/exclusive create and descriptor flag access for writable VFS
clients. Preserve component-wise lookup and live unlinked objects.

Cover sparse/empty I/O, alias seeks, exclusive final links and failed
operations while retaining all existing VFS regressions.

Signed-off-by: vince <vincepaul.liem@gmail.com>
